{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/extras/25c8960b8ba88e8f108c0eb2f7451823.avif?t=1774407576\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Dustoria</strong>, you begin with a few structures and a wide, open desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No enemies. No timers. Just soft winds, golden light, and the slow joy of building something from nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose how your settlement takes shape, there's no rush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/extras/848592920c381dd1cb622515a057b06a.avif?t=1774407576\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each building gives points based on where and how you place it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your water collector near moisture, solar panels in open areas, farms close to homes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s part strategy, part creativity, like a puzzle you build at your own rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/extras/cb706b938bd20ddeab72fe3bd5467095.avif?t=1774407576\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you level up, you gain a new piece of land. These extra tiles are procedurally generated and can be placed wherever you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to expand near your water collectors? Or leave space for future buildings? It's up to you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3742110?t=1774407576","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3742110?t=1774407576","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/6f5dd8299ca1fdedda8cb837a2a256fa558a3aa3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774407576","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/6f5dd8299ca1fdedda8cb837a2a256fa558a3aa3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774407576","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/extras/25c8960b8ba88e8f108c0eb2f7451823.avif?t=1774407576\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Dustoria</strong>, you begin with a few structures and a wide, open desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No enemies. No timers. Just soft winds, golden light, and the slow joy of building something from nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose how your settlement takes shape, there's no rush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/extras/848592920c381dd1cb622515a057b06a.avif?t=1774407576\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each building gives points based on where and how you place it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your water collector near moisture, solar panels in open areas, farms close to homes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s part strategy, part creativity, like a puzzle you build at your own rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/extras/cb706b938bd20ddeab72fe3bd5467095.avif?t=1774407576\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you level up, you gain a new piece of land. These extra tiles are procedurally generated and can be placed wherever you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to expand near your water collectors? Or leave space for future buildings? It's up to you.</p>","developers":["Voxel Bytes"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/203d1f9c8a359f160f46ea6a0f45128ae3a45937/header.jpg?t=1774407576","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel i3 8th gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GT 1030 2gb<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sequoia<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3742110/256278649/9a114e0a614b1aedddc26f9e9b8f843ec010ea4f/1751310568/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751312888","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3742110/256278649/9a114e0a614b1aedddc26f9e9b8f843ec010ea4f/1751310568/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751312888","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3742110/256278649/9a114e0a614b1aedddc26f9e9b8f843ec010ea4f/1751310568/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=175131